			"notes": "## Let Your Friend Drink 1.0.1\n\n- Adds Fabric and the complete six-target release matrix.\n- Keeps one loader-neutral native drink core with loader/version-specific Let Your Friend Eating bridges.\n- Replaces the NeoForge-only completion event with a loader-neutral completion callback API.\n- Preserves base-mod cooldowns/statistics, recipient-side native completion, and feeder-owned remainder transfer.\n\n**Targets**\n- Minecraft 1.21.1 · Fabric / NeoForge\n- Minecraft 26.1.2 · Fabric / NeoForge\n- Minecraft 26.2 · Fabric / NeoForge"
		},
